  "explanation": "The source documents explicitly state that Dominique Villars was a member of the 'Academy of Sciences of Turin' (D1S5, D1S9-D1S16) and was inducted into the 'Academia Europaea' (D2S2, D2S5, D2S14). While D2S17 mentions he was 'recognized by the French Academy of Sciences' and awarded the 'Prix de Coincy', it does not explicitly state he was a 'member' of that specific organization, unlike the other two. Therefore, only the first two are retained as direct answers to the membership question."
